=======================================================
pWire: Wire patch (equivalent to DEF NETS wiring RECT).
-------------------------------------------------------
box: rect, Bounding box of the shape
boxTrimMetal: rect, The box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_area: area, Area of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ll: pt, Lower left (ll) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_llx: coord, Lower left X (llx) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_lly: coord, Lower left Y (lly) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_size: pt, Size of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_sizex: coord, Size X of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_sizey: coord, Size Y of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ur: pt, Upper right (ur) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_urx: coord, Upper Right X (urx) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
boxTrimMetal_ury: coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of the box of this patch wire trim metal
box_area: area, Area of bounding box of the shape
box_ll: pt, Lower left (ll) of bounding box of the shape
box_llx: coord, Lower left X (llx) of bounding box of the shape
box_lly: coord, Lower left Y (lly) of bounding box of the shape
box_size: pt, Size of bounding box of the shape
box_sizex: coord, Size X of bounding box of the shape
box_sizey: coord, Size Y of bounding box of the shape
box_ur: pt, Upper right (ur) of bounding box of the shape
box_urx: coord, Upper Right X (urx) of bounding box of the shape
box_ury: coord, Upper Right Y (ury) of bounding box of the shape
colorTrimMetal: int, The color of this patch wire trim metal
hasTrimMetal: bool, Indicates the wire has trim metal or not
layer: obj(layer), Pointer to layer of patch
mask(settable): int, Indicates mask number for multiple mask layer usage. Refer to layer's .numMask attribute for legal range, 0 indicates uncolored.
net: obj(net), Pointer to net that the patch belongs to
objType: enum(antennaData antennaModel bndry bump bumpGrid bumpTerm bus busGuide busSinkGroup cellDensity densityShape fPlan foreign gCellGridDef group guiLine guiPoly guiRect guiText hInst hInstTerm hNet hTerm head inst instTerm io layer layerRule layerShape libCell marker net netGroup pBlkg pWire pd pgInstTerm pin pinGroup pinGuide pinShape pkgComponent pkgObject prop ptn ptnCell ptnPinBlkg rBlkg resistor resizeBlkg routeType row rule sViaInst sWire sdp shape shapeVia site stackViaRule term text topCell trackDef vCell vWire via viaInst viaRuleGenerate whatIfVia whatIfWire wire), Object type: pWire
pt: pt, Reference point to symbolic location
pt_x: coord, X of reference point to symbolic location
pt_y: coord, Y of reference point to symbolic location
rule: obj(rule), Pointer to non-default rule corresponding to the wire, wires with the default routing rule will return NULL (0x0).
status(settable): enum(cover fixed noshield routed unknown), Wiring status (equivalent to DEF NETS regular wiring status)
